For Nuxt 4 + Vuetify, I would structure things slightly differently than a generic Vue project.

The biggest advantage of Vuetify is that many sections become composable layouts built from VContainer, VRow, VCol, VCard, VExpansionPanels, VTimeline, VParallax, etc., rather than lots of custom HTML.

A lean competitive rafting-tour site would look like this:

